        "repeats": false,
        "readOnly": false
      },
      {
        "linkId": "Section-31/N2005",
        "prefix": "N2005",
        "text": "Did the facility or setting contact and complete the actions prescribed or recommended by the physician, or the physician's designee, by midnight of the next calendar day each time potential clinically significant medication issues were identified for the patient since their admission?",
